{"unit_id":"epsilonH-eps__dsh-tts-bridge-wechatagent-bridge#card-zh","repo":"epsilonH-eps/dsh-tts-bridge-wechatagent-bridge","commit":"9855e6edded2d91f67d8a29204573c3a835746f9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tts-bridge-wechatagent-bridge 是面向 WeChatAgent 微信会话的 DSH 桌面工具插件，可把一段文字念成微信原生语音消息并发送到当前聊天。它注册 wechat_voice_send 工具，从当前会话映射目标微信聊天，优先录制朗读桥在 Edge 中播放的声音；没有声音时可用 edge-tts 生成语音，再裁剪音频、编码为 SILK，并通过 WeChatAgent hook 或 Frida 发送。适合希望让微信里的智能体用语音回复短句的场景。需要 Windows、匹配版本微信、WeChatAgent、Python 环境和 SILK 编码器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:101-140","lib/bridge.py:105-162","lib/bridge.py:306-363"]}
